```
Hi Ken,

M.V. Supply built its name on medium voltage supply and grounding, and on the materials that are hard to find. Transformers sit at the centre of that line card, and a second manufacturing source is what usually keeps the hard-to-find end covered.

We're JZPE Power Transformer, a manufacturer in Suzhou, China. Our three-phase liquid-immersed line is UL listed — E541627 for distribution and pad-mount, 45–5,000 kVA; E541626 for power transformers, 750–110,000 kVA — and built to IEEE C57.12.

Which ranges do you move most — pad-mount and distribution, or the larger medium voltage units? Reply "SPECS" and I'll send the matching spec sheets, UL certificates and factory test reports.

If this isn't useful, reply "stop" and I won't write again.

Best regards,

Ian Chou
```

